SEL OUTPUT_TYPE \, where OUTPUT_TYPE is one of "html" \, "inner" \,
"text" \, "href" \, "none". "html" — returns the selected element HTML
content \, "inner" — returns inner HTML content without the element
surrounding tags \, "text" — returns element text without tags \, "href"
— returns the href attribute of the selected element \, "none" — returns
an empty string. Type: list.;
